  "title": "Chicago Deep-Dish Pizza Muffins",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s Chicago deep-dish pizza muffins come with a beautiful golden crust and a meaty, cheesy, saucy filling that you can actually eat by holding in your hands!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-01-14T09:00:00-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-10-28T09:12:23-04:00",
