    "description": "Try this bite-sized take on a Chicago delicacy. In this video, Chef John shows you how to make Chicago Deep-Dish Pizza Muffins. The recipe requires Chicago-style pizza dough, cooked crumbled Italian sausage, diced sweet peppers, diced provolone, grated mozzarella, Parmesan, and pizza sauce. To make the muffins, the dough is rolled out and cut into circles. Place the circles into the muffin tin and push them up the sides. Fill the inside with the cheese, sausage, and pepper mixture. After baking, this saucy and delicious snack is ready to eat!",
